  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Euro Egyptian Cultural Programme 2023-2027.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Euro Egyptian Cultural Programme 2023-2027. - The EU-Egypt Association Agreement in force since 2004 has provided the legal frame for EU-Egypt bilateral cooperation. The EU-Egypt Partnership Priorities, set the political framework of the partnership until 2027. Deriving from the Partnership Priorities, a multi-annual indicative programme sets the priorities for EU-Egypt cooperation from 2021 to 2027.The action seeks to promote and operationalise the commitments outlined in the EU-Egypt Partnership Priorities, through one dedicated cooperation facility, which will aim to sustain and deepen Egypt&#xbf;s reforms towards a sustainable and inclusive growth pathway.The Overall Objective (Impact) of this action is to contribute to enhancing cooperation and mutual understanding between the EU and Egypt. The outcome aims to increase the pace and quality of implementation of policy reforms and policy convergence in the areas outlined in the EU-Egypt partnership priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
